
@api=http://localhost:3000/api
### book list
GET {{api}}/books

### add book
POST {{api}}/books
{
    "title": "New book",
    "writer": "Kelsey"
}

### get a book   fetch().then(res => res.json())
GET {{api}}/books/2


### patch a book
PATCH {{api}}/books/2

{
    "title": "New title",
    "writer": "Nayoun"
}

### delete a book
DELETE {{api}}/books/2